   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Sunlit beauty: median ~128, warm cream highlights (231,215,202), warm-brown shadows (33,28,25), red-orange dominant, warm-rose skin (170,129,102 / hue 24), saturation 0.29, soft polished skin. Best for: Beauty-led bridal portraits, haldi and golden-hour sun, close-up jewellery and makeup frames, natural-light pre-wedding shoots. The most "beauty cover" look for soft daylight.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
